          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now the Philistines had taken God’s ark, and they brought it from Ebenezer to Ashdod.",
      "ko": "블레셋 사람이 하나님의 궤를 빼앗아가지고 에벤에셀에서부터 아스돗에 이르니라",
      "source_text_hash": "70820b58b51fc7ab5c9720cb7c22793da7716243d901e2bac19dde03d2ecda39",
      "translation_text_hash": "53946387c84f978451672c867c9a5c203ef974560060d3318aa24b0a8469a2a4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
